Hi Folks,

some time ago I read about robbing a shop full of potions. My strategy for
robbing this kind of shop is as follows:






































































Of course, all you need is the pick-axe. Similar to the common method you have to
dig a hole into the wall. But, the trick will be to enter the shop twice.
First, you dig the hole, then dig further to leave the shop. After that you build
a trapdoor with your pick-axe (and falling through). Come back, take the potions,
and then, when standing in the hole (at this moment, you do not leave the shop),
dig a trap (of course, you are falling into). And now, try to escape from your
pit, jumping into the trapdoor. The shopkeeper will not be so fast to catch you (probably falling into the pit in the wall), and the Keystone Kops do not
follow you to the next level. Of course, when comming back, take care.

Have fun,
  Joerg 


